sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer
  participant Web
  participant Worker as Booking Worker
  participant Firestore
  Customer->>Web: escolhe serviço/profissional/horário
  Web->>Worker: POST /api/bookings
  Worker->>Firestore: valida tenant/service/professional
  Worker->>Firestore: commit Appointment + bookingLocks (exists=false)
  alt horário livre
    Firestore-->>Worker: commit OK
    Worker-->>Web: 201 appointment
  else conflito
    Firestore-->>Worker: precondition conflict
    Worker-->>Web: 409 horário indisponível
  end
